{%- liquid
  if section.settings.device_frame != blank
    assign df_src = section.settings.device_frame | image_url: width: 600
  else
    assign df_src = 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url
  endif
-%}
{% style %}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.color_background }};
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}
<div class="wrap">
  <section class="ch" id="switch-on"><p class="ch__num">07 · Every session</p><h2>Pre-heat and temperature</h2><p class="ch__lead">You choose how long Diamond warms the cup and how hot you smoke. The two belong together.</p><span id="temperature" class="anchor"></span><div class="feat feat--mac"><div class="mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ df_src }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="timer" role="img" aria-label="Setting the pre-heat time, minute by minute"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div><h3>Pre-heat time</h3><p>Diamond warms the tobacco before the first draw, so the cup is ready when you are. 7 minutes at 275 °C (527 °F) is the standard; set it in whole minutes, up to 15. 5 minutes at a higher heat gives an intense start, but the flavor fades sooner.</p></div></div><h3>Find your heat</h3><div class="hf2"><div class="mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ df_src }}" alt="ENSŌ Diamond, front"><div class="lv" role="img" aria-label="The dial set to your heat"></div></div></div><div class="hf__q"><div class="hf__g"><b>Your tobacco</b><div class="hf__opts"><button type="button" data-hf="leaf" data-v="virginia" aria-pressed="true">Virginia<small>Blonde leaf</small></button><button type="button" data-hf="leaf" data-v="dark" aria-pressed="false">Burley<small>Dark leaf, heavier</small></button><button type="button" data-hf="leaf" data-v="mix" aria-pressed="false">A mix<small>Virginia and dark</small></button></div></div><div class="hf__g"><b>How you like it</b><div class="hf__opts"><button type="button" data-hf="str" data-v="soft" aria-pressed="true">Lighter<small>Smooth and long</small></button><button type="button" data-hf="str" data-v="strong" aria-pressed="false">Stronger<small>More body</small></button></div></div><dl class="hf2__out" aria-live="polite"><div><dt>Pre-heat</dt><dd class="hf2__pre"></dd></div><div><dt>Session heat</dt><dd class="hf2__t"></dd></div><div><dt>Profile to try</dt><dd class="hf2__prof"></dd></div></dl><p class="hf2__note">A starting point. Turn the dial by taste: the harder you draw, the more heat you need.</p></div></div><h3>On the dial</h3><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:5"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Set the time</b><p>Pre-heat Timer → click, turn to set up to 15 minutes, click to save.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ df_src }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="timer" role="img" aria-label="Set the time: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Start</b><p>Start Pre-heat → click. The screen counts down.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ df_src }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="start" role="img" aria-label="Start: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Set the temperature</b><p>While it counts down, turn the dial: 180–320 °C (356–608 °F). A sound tells you the session has started.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ df_src }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="temp" role="img" aria-label="Set the temperature: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Adjust in the session</b><p>Turn the dial any time to go warmer or cooler. Turn fast and it jumps in fives.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ df_src }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="session" role="img" aria-label="Adjust in the session: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">5</span><b>Stop</b><p>Click twice, turn to Yes, click. Works during pre-heat and during the session.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ df_src }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="stop" role="img" aria-label="Stop: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><p class="more"><a href="#profiles">Profiles: a starting heat for each kind of blend ›</a></p><div class="note note--tip"><b>What Diamond remembers</b><ul><li>The pre-heat time and the pre-heat temperature are saved to the profile you are on.</li><li>Turning the temperature during the session changes this session only.</li></ul></div><div class="note note--tip"><b>No auto-off</b><ul><li>The session runs until you switch off, or until the battery runs low.</li></ul></div><h3 id="break">Pause the session</h3><div class="feat feat--mac"><div class="mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ df_src }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="brk" role="img" aria-label="Turning the dial down to 180 °C (356 °F)"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div><p>Turn the dial down to 180 °C (356 °F). Diamond keeps the cup warm without burning the tobacco, so you can step away for up to 15 minutes. Back again? Turn up to your heat.</p></div></div><h3 id="burnt">If it starts to taste burnt</h3>
  {%- liquid
    assign preheat_count = section.blocks.size | plus: 1
  -%}
  <div class="slider tslider" style="--n:{{ preheat_count }}"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Turn the dial down</b><p>Ten or twenty degrees is enough.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ df_src }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="down" role="img" aria-label="Turn the dial down: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure>
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      <figure class="slide ts" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">{{ forloop.index | plus: 1 }}</span><b>{{ block.settings.step_title }}</b>{{ block.settings.step_body }}</figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">
        {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
          {{- block.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: block.settings.image.alt | default: '' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div></figure>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "DM: Pre-heat",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Device frame"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "device_frame",
      "label": "Diamond device frame image"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "color_background",
      "label": "Background",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding top (desktop)",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding bottom (desktop)",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding top (mobile)",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding bottom (mobile)",
      "default": 0
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "preheat_step",
      "name": "Pre-heat Step",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "Step image"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step_title",
          "label": "Step title"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "step_body",
          "label": "Step description"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "DM: Pre-heat"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
